<title>USA: Damark to open new telephone order site.</title>
<headline>Damark to open new telephone order site.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Damark International Inc said Monday it is finalizing a lease to open a new teleservice facility in Fayetteville, N.C.</p>
<p>The facility will employ more than 250 workers by the end of 1997, Damark said. The direct marketing company now operates teleservice facilities in Minneapolis and Junction City, Kan. ((-- Reuter Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
